SET CUTOFF_AP TO 22200.
LOCK THROTTLE TO 1.
LOCK STEERING TO HEADING(180, 90).
STAGE.
WAIT UNTIL ALTITUDE > 1000.
LOCK STEERING TO HEADING(180, 60).
WAIT UNTIL ALTITUDE > 4000.
LOCK STEERING TO HEADING(180, 45).
WAIT UNTIL APOAPSIS > CUTOFF_AP.
LOCK THROTTLE TO 0.
PRINT "cutoff".
WHEN VERTICALSPEED < 0 THEN { CHUTES ON. PRINT "chutes". }
WAIT UNTIL ALTITUDE < 100.
PRINT "down".
